-----------------------------------------------------------------------
**Chimantano** (/' *ximɑntaːnoː* /, *[[khegh-madul|Khegh Madul]]*: ᠬᠢᠮᠠᠨᠲᠠᠨᠥ) is a lesser deity of Courage and Redemption. 

-----

Anyone who wishes to be accepted by Chimantano, must first conquer his own fears. They must face three trials of own choosing and subsequently offer three relics to Chimantano.

